{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented per the review's advisory: the fixture now shrinks _GIT_TIMEOUT only when a subcommand is armed (as the sibling fix does), and the healthy test no longer arms one, so it runs with the wrapper on PATH under the production bound. 1.2 s-per-start shim: 1 passed in 15.14 s (before: timed out after 1s). Module: 6 passed."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795256177245868001,"uuid":"53f5cdbe-d215-4bff-97f7-14cb380fedd3"}